  "description": "Hee-Won Jang, a once-revered film director, watched her reputation shatter as disturbing details of her abusive behavior surfaced. Teetering on the brink of professional ruin, an email from an enigmatic sponsor introduces a daring proposal—a series of adult videos starring Jae-Hee, a former fan, and one of the actors whose career she ruined. Reluctantly, Hee-Won and Jae-Hee agree. As they are forced to collaborate, will the lens uncover unexpected love or their shameful dark secrets?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
